@startuml DIGITALAPPStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Ready

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Ready : Init()
Ready --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

Ready --> Ready : WriteGpio()
Ready --> Ready : ReadGpio()
Ready --> Ready : StartPwm()
Ready --> Ready : StopPwm()

note right of Ready
  Stateless.
  Each call is an independent
  driver-level operation.
end note
@enduml